<title>CANADA: UGG estimates W. Canada canola supply/disposition.</title>
<headline>UGG estimates W. Canada canola supply/disposition.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Grain Growers on Wednesday detailed its estimate of supply and disposition of western Canadian canola based on a farmer survey by UGG elevator managers June 2-4.</p>
<p>			     WESTERN CANADA ('000 T)</p>
<p>	   Forecast 97/98    Forecast 96/97   Five-Yr-Avg</p>
<p>Supply</p>
<p>Openg Stox   463		   925		  549</p>
<p>Output     6,605		 5,037		5,458</p>
<p>Total	7,113		 6,033		6,070</p>
<p>Disposition</p>
<p>Exports    2,725		 2,420		2,767</p>
<p>Seed	    40		    35		   32</p>
<p>Human Food 3,100		 2,675		2,241</p>
<p>Feed/Waste   552		   440		  379</p>
<p>Total	6,417		 5,570		5,419</p>
<p>Carry Out    696		   463		  651</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
